{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-meet-science2-29","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"chemistry","number":29,"points":null,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"E)·R)","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","organic_properties","organic_rxn"],"stem":"다음은Cannizzaro 반응과정을간략하게나타낸것이다.\n<실험과정>\n2 PhCHO ＋KOH →\nPhCOOH ＋PhCH2OH\n(가) Benzaldehyde에KOH 수용액을넣어주고잘교반한다.\n적당한용매조건에서정상(normal phase) TLC를\n수행하여반응진행정도를확인한다.\n(나) Benzaldehyde가없어진것을확인한후물을넣는다.\n(다) 수용액층을에터(ether)로추출한다.\n(라) 단계(다)의유기층에서생성물A를얻는다.\n(마) 단계(다)의수용액층을산성화시켜생성물B를얻는다.\n단계(가)의실험중확인한TLC 결과가아래와같다. 생성물\nA의이름과TLC에서생성물B의위치를바르게짝지은것은?\n3\n2\n1\nA의이름\nB의위치","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"benzoic acid 1","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019","t020","t021"]},{"number":2,"text":"benzoic acid 2","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022","t023","t024"]},{"number":3,"text":"benzyl alcohol 1","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025","t026","t027"]},{"number":4,"text":"benzyl alcohol 2","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028","t029","t030"]},{"number":5,"text":"benzyl alcohol 3","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031","t032","t033"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":744,"height":467,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,27.204,297.6,186.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-meet-science2-29/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":751,"height":263,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,265.604,300.4,105.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-meet-science2-29/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[373.089,66.396,690.55,560.322],"width":317.462,"height":493.926,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01